623	  142|   Let $T > 0$. The form
624	  143|   \[
625	  144|     \langle f,g\rangle_a
626	  145|     = \int_0^T\int_0^T f(t)g(s)|t-s|^{-a}\ud t\ud s
627	  146|   \]
